{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05442","headline":"奉和圣制送张说巡边 · 卢从愿","name":"奉和圣制送张说巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上将发文昌，中军静朔方。\n占星引旌节，择日拜坛场。\n礼乐临轩送，威声出塞扬。\n安边俟帷幄，制胜在岩廊。\n作鼓将军气，投醪壮士觞。\n戒途遵六月，离赠动三光。\n槐路清梅暑，蘅臯起麦凉。\n时文仰雄伯，耀武震遐荒。\n衽席知无战，兵戈示不忘。\n伫闻歌杕杜，凯入系名王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢从愿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}